# Image builds only need the TypeScript workspace.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
docs
platform
scripts
**/*.md
**/test
**/evals
# Skills (SKILL.md) are runtime files the agents load, so they go into the image.
!packages/skills/*/SKILL.md
!agents/*/*/skills/*/SKILL.md
